Core/Jessie: God, I missed being outside. Even if it’s a death trap.
Core/Rose: You’re one of those people who actually liked running into burning buildings, aren’t you?
Core/Jessie: Beats sitting in a lab coat all day.
Core/Rose: That lab coat kept me temperature-controlled and protected from chemical splashes, thank you very much.
Core/Jessie: And I bet you looked sooo badass in it.
Core/Rose: …I still wear it, actually.
Core/Jessie: Seriously?
Core/Rose: It has pockets. Don’t judge me.